{{#summaryHeading}}
{{>heading}}
{{/summaryHeading}}
{{#notes}}
<p>{{#messages}}{{separator}}{{text}}{{/messages}}</p>
{{/notes}}
<p>Engines: {{engines}} · DOM: {{status}}; {{observations}} test observations.</p>
<p>{{semantics}}</p><p>Green: executed. Red: never executed. Amber: some statements on this line did not execute. Grey: no measured statement.</p>
<div class="scroll"><table class="source"><thead><tr><th>Line</th><th>Hits</th><th>Original source</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{{#sourceRows}}
<tr id="L{{number}}" class="{{state}}"><td class="number"><a href="#L{{number}}">{{number}}</a></td><td class="hits">{{hits}}</td><td class="code">{{text}}</td></tr>
{{/sourceRows}}
</tbody></table></div>
<h2>Template statements</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Line:column</th><th>Expression / directive</th><th>Syntax</th><th>Executions</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{{#statements}}
<tr class="{{status}}"><td><a href="#L{{line}}">{{position}}</a></td><td>{{binding}}</td><td>{{syntax}}</td><td>{{hits}}</td></tr>
{{/statements}}
</tbody></table>
{{#scriptCounters}}
<h2>Inline script functions and branches</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Line:column</th><th>Kind</th><th>Name / type</th><th>Executions</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{{#rows}}
<tr class="{{status}}"><td><a href="#L{{line}}">{{position}}</a></td><td>{{kind}}</td><td>{{label}}</td><td>{{hits}}</td></tr>
{{/rows}}
</tbody></table>
{{/scriptCounters}}
{{#references}}
<h2>PHP output and child templates</h2><p>These links describe rendered output. Execution counters stay in each child template; rendering alone does not cover a statement. Additional generated code without mapped counters is not assigned invented source locations.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Source line</th><th>Output</th><th>Source attribution</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{{#rows}}
<tr><td><a href="#L{{line}}">{{line}}</a></td><td>{{status}}</td><td>{{reason}}{{#targets}}<br><a href="{{link}}">{{label}}</a>{{/targets}}</td></tr>
{{/rows}}
</tbody></table>
{{/references}}
